systems fail, and running the infrastructure software depends on."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"I learn by building. That means a church service planner with a live document preview, a Telegram bot that remembers its people, a verification pipeline that reports where teams already work, and a self-hosted deployment environment I operate and troubleshoot myself."}],["$","p",null,{"children":["I care about the difference between"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-foreground","children":"concept"}],","," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-foreground","children":"in development"}]," and"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-foreground","children":"working"}]," — this portfolio labels all three honestly, because engineering credibility starts with accurate claims."]}]]}]}]]}],["$","$L18",null,{"delay":0.08,"label":"FOCUS_PANEL","children":["$","aside",null,{"aria-label":"Current focus","className":"h-fit rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-6","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"label-mono text-muted-foreground","children":"Currently"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3.5","children":[["$","li","Studying",{"className":"grid grid-cols-[92px_1fr] gap-3 text-sm","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent-blue","children":"Studying"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"Cybersecurity — web security fundamentals, Linux, networking"}]]}],["$","li","Building",{"className":"grid grid-cols-[92px_1fr] gap-3 text-sm","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent-blue","children":"Building"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"Order of Service, this portfolio, and automated verification tools"}]]}],["$","li","Operating",{"className":"grid grid-cols-[92px_1fr] gap-3 text-sm","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[11px] upp